The benchmark instances are obtained from public sources. Download the necessary instances and extract them under the instances folder.
For depot configurations, given an instance, we use the program in Arnold, F., & Sörensen, K. (2021). A progressive filtering heuristic for the location-routing problem and variants. Computers & Operations Research, 129, 105166. to generate a set of depot configurations.
When we run the code, this parameter can be removed.
